      "message": "@Trilok\n\u003e\u003eVivek, do we have any kernel command knowledge that hibernation is enabled through bootloader passing it?\n\u003e\u003e\u003e\n\nNo, once the kernel has resumed, it will not be able to differentiate between Bootloader based restore or kernel based hibernation restore. The dmesg history will just depict that hibernation cycle has been performed.",
      "parentUuid": "c3d7a995_a94b0567",
      "revId": "f0175ec5e6ec04be647f3dc298b759f6ec3e6b3e",
